# Rows of the SVG mask oracle (docs/TESTING.md T3, "SVG"). Data only: the expected answer is not
# here. `python tests/oracle/svg.py regen` rasterizes each row with resvg into
# tests/oracle/svg.json as the 8-bit alpha plane, and src/test/svgOracleCheck.ms rasterizes the
# same file through the svgMask module and compares.
